' bug-227: an ISOLATED FUNC must be project-visible (PUBLIC — the default — or
' EXPORT). An explicit PRIVATE ISOLATED FUNC is rejected. Pre-fix this was
' mis-classified as TYPE_CALL_ARGUMENT_MISMATCH; the fix introduced a dedicated
' TYPE_ISOLATED_NOT_VISIBLE (2-203-0113) and reports it here instead.
PRIVATE ISOLATED FUNC w(x AS Integer) AS Integer
  RETURN x
END FUNC

FUNC main AS Integer
  RETURN 0
END FUNC
